              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jillian"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wonderful chicken salad with a creamy honey mustard dressing! I used leftover grilled chicken vs. canned and substituted chopped red delicious apples for the green grapes. I also used fresh chives instead of dried. It's crunchy and sweet - a definite keeper."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Outstanding! I used grilled chicken breasts that had been marinated in Italian dressing instead of canned chicken. I didn’t have chives, so I skipped that, but I added pecans. The chicken was more than the recipe called for. I didn’t add salt because the marinade is pretty salty by itself.",
            "datePublished": "2024-04-15T19:41:21.020Z"
          },
          {
