              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is really tasty! I added tarragon...Ina Garden's secret ingredient for chicken salad. It gave it just the little flavor kick it needed. I also added 1T more honey b/c I thought it seemed too tart. Great recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2010-03-15T14:58:29.540Z"
