              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Charlie T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good. I particularly liked the tartness of the cranberries. After tasting, I felt it needed more acid, so I added a little white wine vinegar. As some other reviewers did, I am going to add curry next time. Maybe some toasted almonds as well.",
