            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "tricia222"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I admit, I was very skeptical at first. However, I would give it more stars if I could. My fiance is a chicken salad-aholic. He said it is the best he has ever had. I made it for a picnic tomorrow, and I hope there is enough left to take! I did use rotisserie chicken instead of canned, shredded in the food processor. Good stuff!",
            "datePublished": "2009-02-20T17:47:44.610Z"
