              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "PamelaSue"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic recipe! I used 2 12.5 oz cans of chicken ... used 1/2 of the celery, added red onion and 4 green onions ... I didn't have green grapes so I addes a few extra red ones ... added 1TBSP lemon juice and 1 tsp curry powder to the dressing ... also added 1/4 cup of toasted almonds and 1/4 cup of toasted pecans ... this is a definite keeper!",
            "datePublished": "2007-12-11T07:54:19.413Z"
